	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. in Christo, vera nostra solidaque salute.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Scripsi ad te heri per <persName ref="p8498">Marcelli</persName> famulum <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>valde illum rogans, ut literas nostras quam primum tibi reddi curaret.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z3"/>Nunc tuas reddidit charissimus ex sorore nepos, qui etiam affirmat in itinere <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>se de reditu tabellarii illius ab <placeName ref="l862">Helvetiis</placeName> abmandati certiorem factum.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z5"/>Quid nostrorum legati apud vestros egerint, plane ignoro, nisi quod frater VI<lb xml:id="p1z6"/>II.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">VIIbris inter alia indicavit abmandatos illos explorandi gratia, <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>nunc quid assecuti sint <placeName ref="l862">Helvetii</placeName>; hoc enim ipsorum referre, ut resciscant, <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>praesertim cum Transrhenani isti abbas <placeName>Vinetensis</placeName>, comes <persName>Foedericus <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>Furstenberg[i]us</persName>, dominus <persName>Maiorangię</persName> et dominus <persName>Ioannes Iacobus Andlangianus</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>a senatu rescire voluerint, velitne conditiones <placeName ref="l18">Augustę</placeName> legatis <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>nostris propositas una omnes admittere necne, cum <placeName ref="l862">Helvetii</placeName> ex iis <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>duas tantum impetrarint.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Praeterea nec frater nec quisquam alius quicquam.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z13"/>Minus vero de istis <foreign xml:lang="el">[griechisch]</foreign> a quoquam accepi, ut <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>maximas tibi gratias habeam pro isto scribendi officio.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Accidit <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>mihi nunc plane, quod antea non raro, ut, quum alii alios plura <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>ad me de statu urbis et ecclesię nostrę scribere putant, ego nihil <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>propemodum harum rerum, quas scire maxime opportebat, accipiam.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z18"/>Sed urgebo importune, ut, nisi ipse rursum in urbem me brevi <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>conferam, nunquam porro hunc in modum cessent.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Utinam non <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>sero, quę <foreign xml:lang="el">[griechisch]</foreign>.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Audio quędam heri tributim <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>a civibus nostris rogata; cuiusmodi vero sint, nemo potuit idicare; <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>expecto autem in horas vel fratris vel <persName ref="p4082">Zviccii</persName> literas.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z23"/>Quę de C[aesare], electore, landtgravio et cęteris nonnullis scribis, hodie <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>plenius accepi, quę et ipsa ad te dare per <persName ref="p8011">Gvaltherum</persName> meum volui.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell"><lb xml:id="p1z25"/>Tu, mi charissime et optime frater, in Christo Iesu ęternum vale.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z26"/>Iusserunt <foreign xml:lang="el">[griechisch]</foreign>, ut hic hęream <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>tantisper, donec me revocent.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Sunt inter nostros non pauci <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>valde <foreign xml:lang="el">[griechisch]</foreign>, a quibus multum periculi <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>metuendum bonis civibus, magis certe quam ab ipsis hostibus.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p1z30"/>Germana mea et optima soror officiose te iubet salvere.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p1z31"/>Saluta tuam domum cum fratribus et amicis, quibuscum nostram <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>caussam Christo Iesu, cui pater omne iudicium dedit, diligenter commenda.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z33"/>Es sind yetzund karrer usß der statt kommen, farend in miner <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>schwöster myli mitt korn gen Bom...; sagend, man habe <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>gestert und hutt morgens all zunfften gehalten und seyen die <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>fischer und ander die hösten ganz guͦt <placeName ref="l2450">Schwytz</placeName> worden.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z37"/>Aber es sind schlecht, grob leut, kan mich uff ir reden <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>nitt lassen, so ich nichts in kainem schriben davon hab.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z39"/>Aber es wänt vylicht yeder, der ander schrib; damitt wirt <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>mir nichts.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="de">Will aber hefftiger anhalten.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Ora pro nobis.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z41"/>Utinam brevi alter alteri laetiora in domino nunciare possit.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z42"/>Ora pro nobis, si unquam prius, diligenter.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Iterum vale.</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z43"/>10. Septembris ad multam noctem, quando et <placeName ref="l257">Constantiam</placeName> scribere <lb xml:id="p1z44"/>opportuit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la">Tuus <lb xml:id="p1z45"/>ut qui tuissimus <persName ref="p8055">A[mbrosius] Bl[aurerus</persName>] <lb xml:id="p1z46"/><persName ref="p8011">Gvaltherus</persName> heri sub quartam advenit<note type="misc">= <persName>Walter von Ulm</persName></note>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse:]</note>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Domino <persName ref="p495">Heinricho <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Bullingero</persName>, amico suo <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>et fratri incomparabili.</s>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z4"/><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
